  "notes": "The document provides a single sample table for 'Rates of Decrement Due to Disability' (Page 49) for ages 20-60 in 5-year bands. No sample mortality rates for active members (pre-retirement) or retirees (post-retirement) are printed in the text; the report only references the use of 'PubG-2010' tables without providing the rate values. Consequently, the target 'Avg_Mort' (blended unisex probability of death for all populations) cannot be constructed as requested because the source data for the primary populations (active/retiree) is missing. The transcribed table contains only disability decrement rates, which are excluded from the mortality blend per instructions. Target rows 65-119 have no source data. The 'Distribution of All Active Participants' (Page 36) and 'Schedule of Retirees' (Page 31) are transcribed as evidence but cannot be used to derive mortality rates without the corresponding rate tables.",
